# Post-ready evidence checklist
# Fill before claiming done / ready for review / ship.
# Agents: attach this (or equivalent) + run ./hooks/post-ready.sh

## Ready claim (one sentence)
-

## Receipts
- [ ] make verify (or N/A — reason):
- [ ] tests (make test / scoped) (or N/A — reason):
- [ ] Board updated (Jira and/or Azure DevOps / GitHub issue):
- [ ] PR / branch via gh (if code shipped):
- [ ] Channel notified or Qs closed (if clarification was open):
- [ ] Citations still valid (list):

## Gate
- [ ] I will not say "ready" without the receipts above
